<title>POLAND: GORAZDZE MAY NET RISES TO PLN 10.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>GORAZDZE MAY NET RISES TO PLN 10.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.98 vs   8.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.99 vs   8.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.17 vs   7.92</p>
